title: Start
tags: headless
---
<<await>>
<<back backdrop appearance:dark duration:0.12 operation:back-fade>>
<<char hero appearance:red position:left zIndex:20 duration:0.12 operation:hero-left>>
<<endAwait>>
Narrator: after join #line:m4-after-join
<<char hero appearance:blue position:right duration:0.08 wait:true operation:hero-right>>
Narrator: after wait #line:m4-after-wait
<<hide hero duration:1 operation:cancelled-hide>>
<<cancel operation:cancelled-hide>>
Narrator: after cancel #line:m4-after-cancel
<<hide hero duration:1 operation:completed-hide>>
<<await operation:completed-hide complete:true>>
Narrator: after complete #line:m4-after-complete
<<curtain closed duration:0.12 wait:true operation:curtain-close>>
Narrator: after curtain close #line:m4-after-curtain-close
<<curtain open duration:0.08 wait:true operation:curtain-open>>
Narrator: after curtain open #line:m4-after-curtain-open
<<curtain closed duration:1 operation:cancelled-curtain>>
<<cancel operation:cancelled-curtain>>
Narrator: after curtain cancel #line:m4-after-curtain-cancel
<<curtain closed duration:1 operation:completed-curtain>>
<<await operation:completed-curtain complete:true>>
Narrator: after curtain complete #line:m4-after-curtain-complete
<<curtain open duration:0 wait:true operation:curtain-reset>>
===

