title: DirectionCommands
---
<<beat begin id:direction-opening over:0.08 ease:cubic-out>>
<<backdrop background_dark>>
<<place hero at:left look:red scale:1 z:5>>
<<shot pose stage:main center:50,50 zoom:1>>
<<beat end join:settle>>
Narrator: direction beat committed #line:m4-direction-beat
<<place hero at:right look:blue via:move over:0.08 join:settle>>
Narrator: direction actor moved #line:m4-direction-move
<<shot cg background_light center:40,60 zoom:1.5 via:cut join:settle>>
Narrator: direction cg shown #line:m4-direction-cg
<<shot pose stage:main center:50,50 zoom:1 rotation:0 via:cut join:settle>>
Narrator: direction stage restored #line:m4-direction-stage
<<leave hero via:fade over:0.08 join:settle>>
Narrator: direction actor left #line:m4-direction-leave
===

title: DirectionMultiStage
---
<<beat begin id:direction-multi-stage>>
<<backdrop background_dark stage:main>>
<<place hero stage:main at:left look:red>>
<<backdrop background_light stage:broadcast>>
<<place hero stage:broadcast at:right look:blue>>
<<shot pose stage:broadcast center:50,50 zoom:1>>
<<beat end join:settle>>
Narrator: broadcast stage shown #line:m4-direction-broadcast
<<shot pose stage:main via:cut join:settle>>
Narrator: main stage restored #line:m4-direction-main-return
<<shot pose view:reaction stage:main center:65,50 zoom:1.8 via:cut>>
<<layout split main:main inset:reaction via:cut join:settle>>
Narrator: split layout shown #line:m4-direction-split
===
